// force a map's NAMED deferred operands, then the kernel's deferred captures,
// and materialize an INLINE operand form (`mask(d, ..)` written in the
// method_for) inside the map's own emission -- after the captures. The
// interpreter resolved every operand first, so the inline mask's modulo by
